@startuml
title Code - client (React App) @ a4993cc, v0.5.1

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

package "client" {
  class "React App" as reactApp <<component>> {
    -data : ApiResponse | undefined
    +sendRequest() : Promise<void>
  }
}

note bottom of reactApp
  Reads SERVER_URL = import.meta.env.VITE_SERVER_URL || "http://localhost:3000".
  sendRequest fetches /hello and casts res.json() to ApiResponse
  (compile-time cast, no runtime validation).
end note

@enduml
